{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras/e90813f92a8f2ab55d3f614a0ca5af79.avif?t=1761123662\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras_big/e90813f92a8f2ab55d3f614a0ca5af79.webp?t=1761123662 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ada finds herself in a mysterious world when she awakens. The world seems different and keeps changing but she just knows that she has to keep going. Ada will face enemies who will do everything they can to prevent her from completing her journey.\u00a0You will help Ada in this path to figure out what is happening to her.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras/3a6b2a11a69a7e5395a383027ddc28fd.avif?t=1761123662\" width=1560 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras/abefc43f5da1c8cb7abb335259d920a3.poster.avif?t=1761123662\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras/abefc43f5da1c8cb7abb335259d920a3.webm?t=1761123662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras/abefc43f5da1c8cb7abb335259d920a3.mp4?t=1761123662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy World of Ada Awaits You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world in Ada will have many different locations that appear cozy but they will have many layers waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras/03ff5a13cee350e38057e90e4e80a6a3.poster.avif?t=1761123662\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras/03ff5a13cee350e38057e90e4e80a6a3.webm?t=1761123662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras/03ff5a13cee350e38057e90e4e80a6a3.mp4?t=1761123662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cute But Dangerous World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some encounters might appear friend shaped but don't fall for it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras/6988a74090d36d07d74798bd508ae05f.poster.avif?t=1761123662\" width=1078 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras/6988a74090d36d07d74798bd508ae05f.webm?t=1761123662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras/6988a74090d36d07d74798bd508ae05f.mp4?t=1761123662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming yet challenging 3D action adventure inspired by the spirit of soulslike games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Ada with third-person controls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and strike with accuracy in combat to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world filled with secrets and hidden stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles that test your reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet  adorable but mysterious characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who seek both comfort and challenge. Mixing cozy elements with a soulslike adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087960?t=1761123662","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/3e3a7bc86dbcc7e69890ffd86fcee2d376e87324/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761123662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/52beb8ae74ae872ce71db91ff56be2c148ccda09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761123662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/52beb8ae74ae872ce71db91ff56be2c148ccda09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761123662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087960/extras/e90813f92a8f2ab55d3f614a0ca5af79.avif?t=1761123662\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.ste